essing emirs’ as subject matter and the question concerning dating.</note></biblStruct><bibl type="formatted" subtype="bibliography" resp="https://www.zotero.org/styles/chicago-note-bibliography-17th-edition">
  Zammit, Martin R. “British Library Add. 14,493: A Very Early <title level="m">Garšūnī </title>Text.” <title level="m">Journal of Semitic Studies</title> 59:2 (2014): 329–56.
